<title>POLAND: FARM FOOD APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>FARM FOOD APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
